{"id":"independent_wdtw","title":"Independent-channel WDTW","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Independent WDTW computes a separate alignment problem for every channel, then averages the resulting distances. The two channels in this example prefer different correspondences. Their paths are shown separately, making explicit that averaging final scores does not impose a shared multivariate warping path.","intro_zh":"独立通道 WDTW 为每个通道分别求解对齐问题，再平均最终距离。本例两个通道偏好的配对不同，动图分别显示各自路径，因此可直接看到平均分数不等于施加共享的多变量扭曲路径。","steps_en":["Keep matching channel identities and define channelwise preprocessing.","Solve the stated WDTW problem independently for channel one and channel two.","Retain each channel's own alignment; different channels may select different time matches.","Take the arithmetic mean of channel distances, with equal weights in this example."],"steps_zh":["保持通道对应关系，并明确各通道预处理。","分别求解通道一和通道二的 WDTW 问题。","保留各通道自身的对齐；不同通道可以选择不同时间匹配。","对通道距离取算术平均；本例使用相等权重。"],"formula":"d_independent(X,Y) = (d_base(X_channel1,Y_channel1)+d_base(X_channel2,Y_channel2))/2","caveats_en":["Independent warping can break simultaneity across channels; use a shared-path definition when simultaneous events must remain coupled.","Channel scale and aggregation convention matter. This atlas uses a mean; some libraries use a sum."],"caveats_zh":["各通道独立扭曲可能破坏通道间同时性；要求同步事件保持耦合时，应选择共享路径定义。","通道尺度和聚合约定会影响结果；本图谱使用平均值，有些库使用求和。"],"sources":[{"label":"aeon: logistic weighted DTW","url":"https://www.aeon-toolkit.org/en/stable/api_reference/auto_generated/aeon.distances.wdtw_distance.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Channel 1 above; both channels and separate paths are recorded in parameters","parameters":{"channels_x":[[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.